        "title": {
          "en": "DuckDB Unveils Quack Protocol for Networked Multi-User Analytics",
          "zh": "DuckDB发布Quack协议 赋能网络多用户分析"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "DuckDB has announced Quack, a new remote protocol over HTTP, enabling multiple DuckDB instances to connect to a single database over a network, adding client-server capabilities to the previously embedded database.",
          "zh": "DuckDB近日宣布推出Quack协议，这是一种基于HTTP的新型远程协议，允许通过网络使多个DuckDB实例连接并操作同一数据库，从而为此前主要为本地嵌入式数据库引入了客户端-服务器功能。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "DuckDB has introduced Quack, a new remote protocol.",
            "The protocol operates over HTTP.",
            "Quack enables multi-user analytics by allowing multiple DuckDB instances to connect to a shared database over a network, introducing client-server capabilities."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "DuckDB推出了名为“Quack”的新型远程协议。",
            "该协议通过HTTP运行。",
            "它使多个DuckDB实例能够通过网络连接并操作同一数据库，从而实现多用户分析，并引入了客户端-服务器功能。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development provides DuckDB with capabilities for collaborative data analytics, which can support AI/ML workflows requiring shared access to data for model training, evaluation, and deployment in networked environments.",
          "zh": "这一进展为DuckDB带来了协同数据分析能力，可支持AI/ML工作流在网络环境中对数据进行共享访问，以进行模型训练、评估和部署。"
        },
        "source": "InfoQ",
        "link": "https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/05/duckdb-quack-protocol/?utm_campaign=infoq_content&utm_source=infoq&utm_medium=feed&utm_term=AI%2C+ML+%26+Data+Engineering-news"
